// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO10-14/18/48 (dedicated onboard TFT
// display + shared SPI bus) and GPIO21/47 (microSD CS/card-detect).
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO0 tagged "button" - confirmed onboard "Button" (IO0)
// per vendor official docs (termod-s3.readthedocs.io hardware page,
// General Pins table: "GPIO0 | Button"; schematic text: "Simple setup for
// ESP32 S3 with buttons(IO0 and EN)"). No onboard user LED or NeoPixel
// exists on this board - vendor docs list only power-indicator LED D1
